  description: "A squat, spotted toadstool with a wide domed cap, rooted deep and
    solid in cool, shaded loam. \n\nA startling little curiosity for the collection,
    more conversation piece than tool. No known use beyond perhaps some amusement.
    Keep away from the cats, they\u2019re light enough to be thrown rather far."
  descriptionSecondary: 'Give it the slightest nudge and it answers with a soft "whump"
    as it throws you back in the direction you came from.

'
